              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Static exposure finding classified as no_static_path"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Tests may reach the change, but the input or fixture evidence is opaque, so static analysis cannot tell whether a wrong result would propagate."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Static evidence only; no test was executed. Next step: make the decisive input or fixture value explicit, then re-run ripr check."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/blob/main/docs/STATIC_EXPOSURE_MODEL.md#exposure-classes",
              "id": "ripr.finding.infection_unknown",
              "name": "ripr infection_unknown",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Static exposure finding classified as infection_unknown"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The changed behavior crosses a boundary static analysis cannot see through, so it is unknown whether a wrong result would reach an observable sink."
